@Project3_Personal_Finance_HostAddress = http://localhost:5084

GET {{Project3_Personal_Finance_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

@token = replace-with-a-valid-jwt

### Popular Vietnam stock quotes
GET {{Project3_Personal_Finance_HostAddress}}/api/Investments/market/popular
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Search Vietnam stocks by ticker or company name
GET {{Project3_Personal_Finance_HostAddress}}/api/Investments/market/search?q=FPT
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Get current quote and one-year price history
GET {{Project3_Personal_Finance_HostAddress}}/api/Investments/market/FPT
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Reject an unknown market symbol
GET {{Project3_Personal_Finance_HostAddress}}/api/Investments/market/NOTAREALSTOCK
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
